WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.536
-I remember my -- I'm trying to
think of my worst costume.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.772
I always forget.
They were always pretty bad,

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.540
but I remember one time
we bought --

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.475
you know the costumes that come
in the box with the cellophane,

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.043
and it was Batman.

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:12.412
I think it was Batman.
-Yeah.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.681
-And my mom made me wear
a sweatshirt over it.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.182
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.651
So basically I was a kid in
a sweatshirt with a Batman mask.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.052
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:21.588
And I had been wearing
it all day.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.423
I was so excited to wear it,
that I had chewed the plastic.

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:26.826
Mouth -- I was, like,
chewing on the mouth thing,

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.728
and it cut my lip open.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.130
So, I had, like,
a bloody mouth and --

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.033
kid in a sweatshirt, Batman,
and I jumped off a stoop

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.201
after I got candy.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.635
And I go, "I'm Batman"
or whatever,

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:38.171
and I jumped off,
and it was so cheap

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.673
that the costume just ripped.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.108
I had, like, jeans
on underneath,

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.277
but I ended up just being a kid
in jeans and a t-shirt.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.911
-With a mouth --
-With a bloody lip.

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:49.115
-Sweatshirt, jeans --
-Yeah, and a bloody lip. Yeah.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.516
That was probably the worst one.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:51.885
But I don't know,
I've had bad ones.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.020
This first one here is
from @JodieColombo.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.488
-Ooh!
-She says,

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.590
"My grandmother wrapped
my cousin up in tinfoil

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.459
for Halloween and said he was
a Hershey's Kiss,

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:01.961
everyone thought
he was leftovers."

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.863
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.131
-Come on!

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.934
[ Applause ]

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.368
Leftovers are good costumes.

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:12.371
-I'm going as old lasagna.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:15.841
This one is from @MemeFinder69.

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:17.710
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.713
-Wow. [ Laughs ]
What?

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.415
I hope that was for
"MemeFinder."

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.984
-Yeah, he was probably born
in 1969.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:27.120
-Yeah, sure.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.555
-He says, "I went as
a hand last Halloween.

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.357
I spent the whole night
getting hit in the face."

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.860
Like...
High five, high five.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.861
Ow.
[ Smack ]

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.029
High five. Ow.
[ Smack ]

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.630
High five. Ow.
[ Smack ]

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.198
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.399
High five, nerd.
[ Smack ]

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:42.235
Ow.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.369
-MemeFinder.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:46.205
-This one's from @RachelLees.

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:49.175
She says, "In 2017 we all went
out as a family group

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.945
of superheroes -- Superman,
Supergirl, and Wonder Woman.

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:56.616
At the last second, my youngest
demanded she dress as poop."

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:59.118
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:01.954
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.557
-Come on, Superpoop.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.959
-This one's from @KellytheWalsh.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:09.729
She said, "I got 50 people at
my high school to wear all gray

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.332
and sunglasses so we could be
50 Shades of Grey.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.101
I was told it wasn't
school appropriate,

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:18.203
and we had to enter the costume
contest as pavement."

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:22.275
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.509
That's pretty good.
-Yeah.

00:02:23.509 --> 00:02:26.512
-I like that one.
-You're not going to win, kid.

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:28.948
-Sexy pavement.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.684
This one's from @ms-emily-allen.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:33.352
She says, "I dressed
as Ariana Grande

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:34.854
for a Halloween party.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.423
On the street, a kid yelled,
"Look, Mom, it's old Ariana.'"

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.125
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:42.528
-There's no need for that.

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:46.131
-Thank you, next.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.131 --> 00:02:48.901
This one's from @JoAnnNJ1.

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:50.269
Says, "I'm a teacher,

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:52.171
and our school Halloween parade
was that day.

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.540
I grabbed a cat costume from
the first store I passed.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.376
Halfway through the parade
another teacher told me

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:58.878
it said "naughty little kitty"
on the back.

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:03.483
-Oh.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:06.586
-Uh, Miss Palmer.
-Excuse me.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:09.221
-This last one here is
from @RickEGreen.

00:03:09.221 --> 00:03:12.225
He says, last year I strapped
a bicycle tire to my neck

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:13.893
and just sit next
to the couples all night,

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.394
I was the third wheel.
-Oh.

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:16.462
-There you go.
There you have it,

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.130
those are our
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.531
To check our more
of our favorites,

00:03:19.531 --> 00:03:21.734
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

